{"seq":3,"slug":"search-strategies-cut","title":"搜索策略与剪枝","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/foundations/search-strategies-cut","wordCount":1607,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"搜索策略与剪枝\">搜索策略与剪枝</h1><p>Prolog 将逻辑推理转化为搜索问题：给定一个目标，在由程序子句定义的搜索树中寻找证明路径。默认的<strong>深度优先</strong>策略简单高效但不完备；<strong>剪枝</strong>（cut）允许程序员修剪搜索树以提升效率或实现确定性控制，代价是可能破坏程序的声明式语义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>围绕搜索控制，本文涉及以下核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>搜索树</strong>：查询诱导的证明树，节点是待证目标，边是子句选择与合一；</li>\n<li><strong>深度优先 + 回溯</strong>：用栈实现的搜索策略，内存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但不完备（可能陷入无限分支）；</li>\n<li><strong>选择点</strong>（Choice Point）：记录状态以备回溯，是运行时的主要内存开销来源；</li>\n<li><strong>cut（<code>!</code>）</strong>：提交当前谓词调用并剪除左侧选择点，代价是可能牺牲声明式语义；</li>\n<li><strong>软剪枝</strong>：<code>-&gt;</code>/<code>;</code>、<code>once/1</code>、<code>det/1</code> 等结构化控制，比裸 cut 更安全；</li>\n<li><strong>迭代加深</strong>：用反复加深的界换取完备性，兼具低内存与可终止。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>对声明式语义的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>深度优先</td>\n<td>默认搜索策略</td>\n<td>无（但可能不终止）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绿色 cut</td>\n<td>仅消除冗余解的优化</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红色 cut</td>\n<td>改变程序答案集</td>\n<td>破坏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-&gt;</code>/<code>once</code></td>\n<td>局部提交，作用域受控</td>\n<td>局部破坏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"prolog-的搜索树\">Prolog 的搜索树</h2><p>每个查询诱导一棵搜索树：根节点是初始目标，子节点通过合一展开，叶节点要么是成功（空目标）要么是失败（无匹配子句）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 定义&#10;path(a, b).&#10;path(b, c).&#10;path(c, d).&#10;route(X, Y) :- path(X, Y).&#10;route(X, Y) :- path(X, Z), route(Z, Y).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>path(a, b).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>path(b, c).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>path(c, d).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>route(X, Y) :- path(X, Y).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>route(X, Y) :- path(X, Z), route(Z, Y).</span></span></code></pre></div><p>查询 <code>?- route(a, d)</code> 的搜索树：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[&quot;route(a,d)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;子句1: path(a,d)&quot;| F1[&quot;FAIL&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt;|&quot;子句2: path(a,Z), route(Z,d)&quot;| N1[&quot;path(a,Z), route(Z,d)&quot;]&#10;    N1 --&gt;|&quot;Z=b&quot;| N2[&quot;route(b,d)&quot;]&#10;    N2 --&gt;|&quot;子句1: path(b,d)&quot;| F2[&quot;FAIL&quot;]&#10;    N2 --&gt;|&quot;子句2: path(b,Z2), route(Z2,d)&quot;| N3[&quot;path(b,Z2), route(Z2,d)&quot;]&#10;    N3 --&gt;|&quot;Z2=c&quot;| N4[&quot;route(c,d)&quot;]&#10;    N4 --&gt;|&quot;子句1: path(c,d)&quot;| S[&quot;SUCCESS&quot;]\">graph TD\n    R[\"route(a,d)\"] --&gt;|\"子句1: path(a,d)\"| F1[\"FAIL\"]\n    R --&gt;|\"子句2: path(a,Z), route(Z,d)\"| N1[\"path(a,Z), route(Z,d)\"]\n    N1 --&gt;|\"Z=b\"| N2[\"route(b,d)\"]\n    N2 --&gt;|\"子句1: path(b,d)\"| F2[\"FAIL\"]\n    N2 --&gt;|\"子句2: path(b,Z2), route(Z2,d)\"| N3[\"path(b,Z2), route(Z2,d)\"]\n    N3 --&gt;|\"Z2=c\"| N4[\"route(c,d)\"]\n    N4 --&gt;|\"子句1: path(c,d)\"| S[\"SUCCESS\"]</pre><h2 id=\"深度优先搜索与回溯\">深度优先搜索与回溯</h2><p>Prolog 选择深度优先、从左到右的搜索策略，因为它可以用栈实现，内存消耗为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为最大深度），而广度优先需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(b^d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 为分支因子）。回溯是深度优先搜索的核心操作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>WAM 实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>选择点（Choice Point）</td>\n<td>记录当前状态以备回溯</td>\n<td><code>try/retry/trust</code> 指令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回溯（Backtracking）</td>\n<td>恢复到上一个选择点继续搜索</td>\n<td>恢复寄存器 + 尾指针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确定性推进</td>\n<td>无需创建选择点的子句选择</td>\n<td><code>execute</code> 直接跳转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾递归优化</td>\n<td>最后一个子句不创建选择点</td>\n<td><code>trust_me</code> + 帧回收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 回溯的可观察效果&#10;color(red).&#10;color(green).&#10;color(blue).&#10;&#10;?- color(X).&#10;X = red ;    % 用户请求更多解&#10;X = green ;  % 回溯到 color/1 的选择点&#10;X = blue.    % 最后一个子句，选择点销毁\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 回溯的可观察效果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>color(red).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>color(green).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>color(blue).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- color(X).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X = red ;    % 用户请求更多解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X = green ;  % 回溯到 color/1 的选择点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X = blue.    % 最后一个子句，选择点销毁</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"深度优先的不完备性\">深度优先的不完备性</h3><p>深度优先搜索可能陷入无限分支而错过有限深度的解：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 左递归导致无限循环&#10;ancestor(X, Y) :- ancestor(X, Z), parent(Z, Y).  % 危险！&#10;ancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Y).&#10;&#10;?- ancestor(tom, ann).  % 无限展开第一个子句，永不到达第二个\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 左递归导致无限循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ancestor(X, Y) :- ancestor(X, Z), parent(Z, Y).  % 危险！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Y).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- ancestor(tom, ann).  % 无限展开第一个子句，永不到达第二个</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解决方案包括：重新排列子句（基础情况在前）、使用迭代加深、或使用 <a href=\"../advanced-topics/tabling-memoization\">Tabling 与记忆化</a>彻底消除重复和循环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cut-搜索树的手术刀\">Cut：搜索树的手术刀</h2><p>Cut（写作 <code>!</code>）是一个零参数的内置目标，执行时总是成功，但其副作用是<strong>移除当前谓词调用的所有剩余选择点</strong>以及该调用点之前体部目标的选择点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 绿色 cut：不改变程序的声明式语义&#10;max(X, Y, X) :- X &gt;= Y, !.&#10;max(_, Y, Y).&#10;&#10;%% 红色 cut：改变了程序的逻辑含义&#10;classify(X, positive) :- X &gt; 0, !.&#10;classify(X, negative) :- X &lt; 0, !.&#10;classify(0, zero).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 绿色 cut：不改变程序的声明式语义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>max(X, Y, X) :- X >= Y, !.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>max(_, Y, Y).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 红色 cut：改变了程序的逻辑含义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>classify(X, positive) :- X > 0, !.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>classify(X, negative) :- X &#x3C; 0, !.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>classify(0, zero).</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"cut-的操作语义\">Cut 的操作语义</h3><p>当 Prolog 执行到 cut 时：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>丢弃当前谓词调用尚未尝试的所有子句（不再回溯）</li>\n<li>丢弃 cut 左侧目标创建的所有选择点</li>\n<li>继续执行 cut 右侧的目标</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>commit</mtext><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>←</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(! succeeds)</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>←</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(选择点被剪除)</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{commit}: \\frac{\\leftarrow A_1, ..., !, ..., A_n \\quad\\text{(! succeeds)}}{\\leftarrow A_1, ..., A_n \\quad\\text{(选择点被剪除)}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">commit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">选择点被剪除</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(! succeeds)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"绿色-cut-与红色-cut\">绿色 Cut 与红色 Cut</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>是否改变逻辑语义</th>\n<th>推荐程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>绿色 cut</td>\n<td>仅优化性能，删除后程序仍给出相同结果</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红色 cut</td>\n<td>删除后程序行为改变</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>应避免</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 绿色 cut 示例：member 检查（成功后无需继续搜索）&#10;member_check(X, [X|_]) :- !.&#10;member_check(X, [_|T]) :- member_check(X, T).&#10;&#10;%% 去掉 cut 后仍然正确，只是会产生冗余解&#10;member(X, [X|_]).&#10;member(X, [_|T]) :- member(X, T).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 绿色 cut 示例：member 检查（成功后无需继续搜索）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>member_check(X, [X|_]) :- !.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>member_check(X, [_|T]) :- member_check(X, T).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 去掉 cut 后仍然正确，只是会产生冗余解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>member(X, [X|_]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>member(X, [_|T]) :- member(X, T).</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"if-then-else-与软剪枝\">if-then-else 与软剪枝</h2><p><code>-&gt;</code> (if-then) 和 <code>;</code> (disjunction) 组合提供了比 cut 更结构化的条件控制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% if-then-else 等价于带局部 cut 的析取&#10;abs(X, Y) :-&#10;    ( X &gt;= 0 -&gt; Y = X ; Y is -X ).&#10;&#10;%% 展开为等价的 cut 形式：&#10;abs(X, Y) :- X &gt;= 0, !, Y = X.&#10;abs(X, Y) :- Y is -X.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% if-then-else 等价于带局部 cut 的析取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abs(X, Y) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ( X >= 0 -> Y = X ; Y is -X ).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 展开为等价的 cut 形式：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abs(X, Y) :- X >= 0, !, Y = X.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abs(X, Y) :- Y is -X.</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>-&gt;</code> 的语义是：如果条件成功，提交到第一个分支（不回溯条件部分）；如果条件失败，执行 else 分支。这是一个<strong>局部 cut</strong>——只在条件的作用域内生效，不影响外部选择点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"迭代加深-深度优先的完备化\">迭代加深：深度优先的完备化</h2><p>迭代加深（Iterative Deepening）结合了深度优先的低内存占用和广度优先的完备性：从深度 1 开始，逐步增加深度限制，每次重新搜索。虽然有重复计算，但时间开销仅为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\frac{b}{b-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2834em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 倍（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 为分支因子）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 通用迭代加深框架&#10;solve_id(Goal) :-&#10;    between(1, inf, Depth),&#10;    solve_bounded(Goal, Depth).&#10;&#10;solve_bounded(true, _) :- !.&#10;solve_bounded((G1, G2), D) :- !,&#10;    solve_bounded(G1, D),&#10;    solve_bounded(G2, D).&#10;solve_bounded(Goal, D) :-&#10;    D &gt; 0,&#10;    D1 is D - 1,&#10;    clause(Goal, Body),&#10;    solve_bounded(Body, D1).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 通用迭代加深框架</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>solve_id(Goal) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    between(1, inf, Depth),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    solve_bounded(Goal, Depth).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>solve_bounded(true, _) :- !.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>solve_bounded((G1, G2), D) :- !,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    solve_bounded(G1, D),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    solve_bounded(G2, D).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>solve_bounded(Goal, D) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    D > 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    D1 is D - 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    clause(Goal, Body),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    solve_bounded(Body, D1).</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SWI-Prolog 的 <code>call_with_inference_limit/3</code> 提供了另一种资源限制方式——按推理步数（而非深度）限制搜索，适用于不确定搜索树形状的场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"确定性声明与编译器优化\">确定性声明与编译器优化</h2><p>现代 Prolog 系统鼓励通过声明而非 cut 来表达确定性意图：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% SWI-Prolog 的确定性声明&#10;:- det(factorial/2).&#10;factorial(0, 1) :- !.&#10;factorial(N, F) :-&#10;    N &gt; 0,&#10;    N1 is N - 1,&#10;    factorial(N1, F1),&#10;    F is N * F1.&#10;&#10;%% Scryer Prolog 倾向使用 if_/3 替代 cut&#10;:- use_module(library(reif)).&#10;max_(X, Y, Max) :-&#10;    if_(X &gt;= Y, Max = X, Max = Y).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% SWI-Prolog 的确定性声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- det(factorial/2).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>factorial(0, 1) :- !.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>factorial(N, F) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    N > 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    N1 is N - 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    factorial(N1, F1),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    F is N * F1.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% Scryer Prolog 倾向使用 if_/3 替代 cut</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(reif)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>max_(X, Y, Max) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if_(X >= Y, Max = X, Max = Y).</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>if_/3</code> 利用<strong>具体化</strong>（reification）将条件结果转化为可合一的布尔值，在保持纯逻辑语义的同时实现确定性选择。这是现代 Prolog 风格中替代 cut 的推荐方式——在<a href=\"../programming-techniques/constraint-logic-programming\">约束逻辑编程</a>中也使用类似的具体化技术来处理条件约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能影响与选择点管理\">性能影响与选择点管理</h2><p>选择点是 Prolog 运行时的主要内存开销来源。每个选择点保存完整的机器状态以支持回溯：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选择点内容</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>典型大小</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>寄存器快照</td>\n<td>所有 WAM 寄存器的副本</td>\n<td>固定开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境指针</td>\n<td>指向父环境帧</td>\n<td>1 word</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾解指针</td>\n<td>指向下一个候选子句</td>\n<td>1 word</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trail 指针</td>\n<td>记录需要撤销的绑定</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>减少不必要选择点的技术：子句索引（自动）、确定性声明（编译器优化）、绿色 cut（手动但安全）、以及 commit 操作符（<code>once/1</code>）。<code>once(Goal)</code> 等价于 <code>(Goal -&gt; true ; fail)</code> —— 只取第一个解，不保留选择点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>搜索策略决定了 Prolog 程序的性能与终止性，本文要点归纳如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>深度优先 + 回溯内存开销低，但可能因左递归陷入无限分支，也无法探索被左侧阻塞的成功路径；</li>\n<li>选择点保存完整的机器状态，是运行时的内存瓶颈，应尽量消除；</li>\n<li>cut 分为绿色（不改变逻辑语义）与红色（改变逻辑语义），生产代码应优先使用绿色 cut 或更结构化的控制；</li>\n<li><code>-&gt;</code>/<code>;</code>、<code>once/1</code>、<code>det/1</code> 等机制在表达确定性的同时，把对声明式语义的破坏限制在可控作用域；</li>\n<li>迭代加深用可接受的重复计算换取完备性，<code>call_with_inference_limit/3</code> 则按推理步数设界；</li>\n<li>现代风格更倾向 <code>if_/3</code> 等具体化（reification）技术替代 cut，保持纯逻辑语义。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>遇到左递归与重复计算导致的性能问题时，<a href=\"../advanced-topics/tabling-memoization\">Tabling 与记忆化</a>提供了引擎级的解决方案；若希望让求解器自动完成「智能剪枝」，<a href=\"../programming-techniques/constraint-logic-programming\">约束逻辑编程</a>是更声明式的路径。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"搜索策略与剪枝","id":"搜索策略与剪枝"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Prolog 的搜索树","id":"prolog-的搜索树"},{"level":2,"text":"深度优先搜索与回溯","id":"深度优先搜索与回溯"},{"level":3,"text":"深度优先的不完备性","id":"深度优先的不完备性"},{"level":2,"text":"Cut：搜索树的手术刀","id":"cut-搜索树的手术刀"},{"level":3,"text":"Cut 的操作语义","id":"cut-的操作语义"},{"level":3,"text":"绿色 Cut 与红色 Cut","id":"绿色-cut-与红色-cut"},{"level":2,"text":"if-then-else 与软剪枝","id":"if-then-else-与软剪枝"},{"level":2,"text":"迭代加深：深度优先的完备化","id":"迭代加深-深度优先的完备化"},{"level":2,"text":"确定性声明与编译器优化","id":"确定性声明与编译器优化"},{"level":2,"text":"性能影响与选择点管理","id":"性能影响与选择点管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"事实、规则与查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/foundations/facts-rules-queries"},"next":{"title":"列表处理与递归","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/programming-techniques/list-processing-recursion"}}